  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "You did great at hunting, Can you feel that ",
      "you're going to be a Warrior? As a reward for ",
      "hunting successfully, I'll give the armlet as ",
      "a reward.",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "Armlet has the space for storing potion so that ",
      "you can use it while you are in battle.",
      "At the same time, it raises some defense ability ",
      "so you have a lower fatality rate.",
      "Fortunately, you got the long armlet which is ",
      "specialized armlet and makes defensive health ",
      "stronger.",
      "",
      "Now, have the other adventure."
    ]
